  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"A piece of Kake art"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Special thanks to Rose Marasco ... and faculty and staff at USM [i.e. University of Southern Maine] for supporting this project. This edition of 100 was silkscreen printed on Mowhawk Superfine, UV Ultra and Handmade Abaca Fiber Paper ... On the homefront, thanks to Women's Studio Workshop ..."--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Single sheet accordion fold book attached to front and back wooden covers has text and color illustrations on one side and illustrated endpapers and front cover. Five illustrated additions are handbound into folds of the accordion. Two are cards, one is a card with a pop-up, one is a glassine envelope containing a slice of dried squash, and one is made from handmade, illustrated, waxed paper with slices of mushroom incorporated into the paper.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Screw and post binding with snakeskin hinges.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Binding is an accordion fold variation called a 'flutter book'.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Condition: no library markings, in protective enclosure.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Edition of 100.</subfield>
  </datafield>
